WEBVTT

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:56.380
G-Gauche...

00:01:59.120 --> 00:02:03.960
In Akatsuki

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:08.000
Gauche... Why is he here...?

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.070
Lag!

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:10.400
Niche...

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:14.150
Why did Noir show up here?

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:19.280
Clearly he's not here to back us up...

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:26.250
What is the meaning of this?

00:02:26.510 --> 00:02:27.270
Where is Roda?

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:30.330
Where are the ones unable to become spirit?

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:34.310
Noir, what's gotten into you?

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:37.060
Where are the ones unable to become spirit?!

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:43.450
Answer me.

00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:45.690
That's enough of this, Noir!

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:47.880
Where have you taken them?!

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:49.230
I don't know!

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:52.330
Fighting amongst themselves?

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:53.440
Sure looks like it.

00:02:55.390 --> 00:02:56.320
Gauche...

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:57.750
Where are they?!

00:02:58.350 --> 00:03:01.370
Unfortunately, Hazel speaks the truth.

00:03:01.370 --> 00:03:03.110
We haven't been informed.

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:05.770
That was Lawrence's job, you see.

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:18.610
You mustn't, Gauche!

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:23.470
Move aside.

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:28.060
You mustn't hurt people!

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:29.850
Niche...

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:33.690
Why? Why are you doing this?

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:36.330
I must stop the Cabernet.

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:40.630
So you came here for the same reason we have?

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:42.850
My goal is to save them.

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:45.410
To protect their hearts.

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:49.410
Them? Do you mean the ones that 
were unable to become spirit?

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:55.040
They were taken to Yuusari Central so their 
hearts could serve as food for the Cabernet.

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:57.650
Why their hearts?

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:02.210
The ones unable to become spirit 
were born from the experiments

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:06.640
of the Amberground government, fusing humans 
with all manner of different things.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:09.430
They are creatures whose heart 
level has been enhanced.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:10.790
I see...

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:15.610
So that's why the Cabernet 
headed straight for Central.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:19.020
That venomous bastard! How dare 
he do something so horrible!

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:20.580
That's not all, however.

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:24.590
Reverse's true aim,

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:28.370
is to use the then powered up Cabernet,

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:31.240
and bring down the artificial 
sun in Akatsuki.

00:04:32.190 --> 00:04:35.170
Bring down... the artificial sun?

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:38.030
Oh, sure I delivered them.

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.350
...straight to the artificial sun.

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:43.670
I delivered the suffering, squirming 
hearts of people not wanting to die...

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:47.910
I've seen people throw away their 
lives in front of my very eyes!

00:04:47.910 --> 00:04:49.550
All because of that artificial sun!

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:53.800
That's right.

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:59.350
Even so... I cannot allow the ones unable 
to become spirit to be sacrificed!

00:04:59.350 --> 00:05:00.480
Move aside!

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.060
I will not!

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:05.910
Shooting Garrard and Hazel won't 
help us stop the Cabernet!

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:12.240
The Gauche that I know... 
would never do such a thing!

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:16.750
Perhaps. But I am no longer Gauche.

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:27.130
I do not believe that a heart, 
once lost, can never be regained.

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:31.680
I cannot think that my heart 
could never be delivered to you!

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:34.830
He plans on shooting a shindan into Noir.

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:39.550
But Gauche-san's heart didn't return even 
after he shot a letter bullet into him!

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:41.410
You gotta have hope, man!

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:44.610
Don't you have someone whose heart 
you want to return yourself?!

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:51.950
I will use every last bit of my heart to 
return you back to the way you were, you'll see!

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:13.680
The Cabernet is near...

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:16.160
We've outstayed our welcome!

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:16.980
Wait!

00:06:22.010 --> 00:06:23.830
Lag!

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:25.110
Lag!

00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:30.650
Your hand!

00:07:10.520 --> 00:07:15.230
There was a limestone cave like 
this underneath the Hill of Prayer?

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:21.910
Gauche!

00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:26.000
I thought I told you.

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:29.010
I am no longer Gauche.

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:39.800
You're wrong.

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:44.460
You are Gauche Suede!

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:47.280
It's just, you've lost that heart!

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:48.570
So I'm...

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:51.920
I thought I also said this...

00:07:52.590 --> 00:07:55.030
A lost heart can never be regained.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:05.330
Furthermore, I have no need 
for my past heart any longer.

00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:07.420
No need?

00:08:07.740 --> 00:08:08.670
For your heart?

00:08:09.350 --> 00:08:13.260
I swore a vow to deliver your heart...

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:16.330
To return your heart, Gauche, no matter what!

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:22.170
Gauche...

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:25.480
Noir!

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:35.700
You only get a few shots.

00:08:45.350 --> 00:08:46.120
These are...

00:08:48.870 --> 00:08:51.750
Gauche's heart?

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:22.620
I'm not going to bring back Gauche...

00:09:23.670 --> 00:09:27.540
Noir! I'm going to erase you from existence!

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:46.640
G-Gauche...

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:49.380
Gauche!

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:01.630
They are all dead...

00:10:02.510 --> 00:10:04.220
Why would they do this?

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:08.080
You needn't worry.

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:11.170
My heart is set.

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:17.420
My heart stands with those who 
were not able to become spirit.

00:10:18.460 --> 00:10:23.300
You who were made sacrifices to the 
government's experiments... I want to save you.

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:26.360
They loathe the government.

00:10:26.360 --> 00:10:31.850
Their hearts yearn and suffer with the 
desire to live, despite ever-encroaching death.

00:10:31.850 --> 00:10:36.820
If I gather them all up into one, 
no human heart could compare!

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:42.500
The Cabernet will devour those hearts, grow 
in power, and take down the artificial sun!

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:45.890
Finally, the Ambergound government which 
caused us all those years of suffering,

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:47.700
will be destroyed by my hands!

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:50.190
The rebirth begins!

00:10:55.930 --> 00:10:58.410
Thank you, Sylvette.

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:01.470
Goodbye.

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:10.030
Brother...

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:30.830
In Gauche's heart... All that 
remains are Noir's memories...

00:11:49.630 --> 00:11:50.780
That's...

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:10.890
You know him, yes?

00:12:10.890 --> 00:12:12.250
You know Lag...

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:18.000
Lag? Are you referring to Lag Seeing?

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:21.880
Where is he?

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:28.630
I delivered him from Coza 
Bel to Cambel Litus.

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:32.160
So it was you?

00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:35.340
Are you Lag's...

00:12:35.340 --> 00:12:36.750
I am his mother.

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:38.680
Mother...

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:44.320
Gauche met my mother in Akatsuki!

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:45.830
I...

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:50.480
I saved him, and he saved me...

00:12:50.480 --> 00:12:52.290
We made it through the perilous journey...

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:55.790
We became friends.

00:12:56.890 --> 00:12:58.170
Is that so?

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:05.130
Lag Seeing is a very important friend to me.

00:13:06.070 --> 00:13:08.930
Thank you, Gauche Suede...

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:16.880
I miss him so...

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:20.560
If I could deliver...

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:28.450
If I could at least deliver 
your heart to Lag Seeing...

00:13:29.590 --> 00:13:31.300
My heart?

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:35.190
It's not possible. You're already...

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:41.950
No... I am a Letter Bee.

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:46.970
I will risk my life to deliver 
your heart to Lag Seeing.

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:52.350
Because that is the job of a Letter Bee.

00:13:53.270 --> 00:13:54.450
Gauche...

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:59.350
Gauche!

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:06.240
I... I'm sorry.

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:10.300
I've begun to steal your heart.

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:12.620
I cannot stop it.

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:41.970
Was that just...?

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:44.810
Was my heart delivered to you?

00:14:46.140 --> 00:14:51.240
Gauche! Gauche! You met my 
mother in Akatsuki, yes?

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:53.620
Your mother?

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:54.900
Yeah.

00:14:55.710 --> 00:15:02.760
I see... So the tragically sad woman who always 
lingers in the bottom of my heart is your mother.

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:09.380
You met her, right? You met her beside 
the artificial sun in Akatsuki!

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:10.130
I am sorry.

00:15:12.070 --> 00:15:18.020
Even if it was true that Gauche Suede met 
your mother, I no longer have that memory.

00:15:18.570 --> 00:15:19.570
Gauche!

00:15:20.280 --> 00:15:25.830
The person known as Gauche 
Suede no longer exists.

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:28.890
No longer exists?

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:35.680
The Cabernet is near.

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:54.260
We must stop it... We must stop the Cabernet!

00:15:54.520 --> 00:16:00.520
Yes... What we have to do right 
now is to stop the Cabernet.

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:05.770
Let's stop it. Together.

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:06.480
Yes.

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:10.830
Lag!

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:11.860
Niche!

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:14.140
Hurry, Lag! The Cabernet is near!

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:15.250
I know!

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:17.980
Let's go, G... Noir.

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:26.500
Shinjirai... Set!

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:29.040
Okay, let's go over the plan.

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:33.550
We'll use Connor's yellow explosions 
to force it above ground.

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:37.530
Lag and I will go with you and use 
our shindans to beat the thing!

00:16:41.690 --> 00:16:45.480
What's wrong, Lag? Does it hurt somewhere?

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:48.690
No, I'm okay, Niche...

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:11.860
Blast the thing real good, Connor!

00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:13.820
Got it!

00:17:13.820 --> 00:17:16.350
The mines I bury are fragments of my hunger!

00:17:18.230 --> 00:17:20.430
Yes, Yellow Explosion!

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:33.940
Here it comes!

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:34.690
Yeah!

00:17:44.610 --> 00:17:46.290
It's bigger than it was before!

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:48.830
And it's got even more spikes!

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:52.580
If we let a gaichuu like this 
break into Central, then...

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:54.250
That's why we can't be scared!

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:01.420
Let's go!

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:23.530
The person known as Gauche 
Suded no longer exists.

00:18:30.560 --> 00:18:33.540
I'm going to stop it! No matter what!

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:41.050
Lag, Steak is acting weird!

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:43.350
Lag!

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:50.020
Finish it off, right away!

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:50.970
Right!

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:57.860
Shindan Load...

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:08.490
Shotgun Blast!

00:19:08.490 --> 00:19:09.870
Blue Thorn!

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:12.000
Resound, Red Needle!

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:13.580
Raven Black!

00:19:41.100 --> 00:19:46.530
Next: Battle in Yuusari Central!
